    {
      "unit": "s0283",
      "zh": "閣門傳宣「王詢安否」，使副皆跪，大使奏「臣等來時詢安」。",
      "literal": "The Privy Council gate conveys the announcement, \"Is Wang Xun well?\"; the envoys all kneel; the lead envoy reports, \"When we departed, Xun was well.\"",
      "idiomatic": "The Privy Council gate conveys the announcement, \"Is Wang Xun well?\" The envoys all kneel, and the lead envoy replies, \"When we departed, Xun was well.\""
    },
    {
      "unit": "s0286",
      "zh": "控鶴官起居畢，引進使鞠躬，通高麗國王詢進奉。",
      "literal": "When officers of the Crane Control guard complete obeisance, the usher bows and announces that Wang Xun, King of Goryeo, presents tribute.",
      "idiomatic": "After the Crane Control officers complete obeisance, the usher bows and announces that Wang Xun, King of Goryeo, presents tribute."
